{"id":"da2b5efe-e846-40ac-a312-168c4b070a68","title":"Color Stream 7","slug":"color-stream-7","collectionSlug":"color-stream","collectionName":"Color Stream","category":"background","categoryZh":"背景动画","description":"A soft, dreamy gradient shader effect featuring a pastel color palette that transitions smoothly across the canvas. The composition begins with a warm beige-cream tone (#f3efe6) as the base layer, establishing a neutral foundation. Overlaid on this base are flowing, organic strands that create wave-like patterns moving diagonally from the upper-left toward the lower-right area. The strands utilize a vibrant gradient transitioning from hot pink (#ff48b0) through cyan-blue (#0078bf) to golden yellow (#ffd400), creating a rainbow-like effect with soft, blurred edges. The strands have a high amplitude (2.6) creating pronounced undulating curves with a spread of 0.45, giving them a fluid, ribbon-like appearance. A zoom blur effect is applied with its center offset to the right (x: 1.05, y: 0.5) and a high intensity of 55, creating a subtle radial blur that emanates from the right side, adding depth and motion to the composition. The spiral parameter (0.3) introduces a gentle rotational distortion. A film grain texture with 0.35 strength is applied across the entire surface, mimicking paper tooth and adding tactile quality. The multiply blend mode of the strands creates darker, more saturated color interactions where they overlap the base. The overall effect is ethereal and contemporary, with soft focus, gentle color transitions, and a sense of flowing movement. The mood is calming yet dynamic, with a pastel aesthetic that feels modern and artistic.","colors":["#f3efe6","#ff48b0","#0078bf","#ffd400"],"labels":["gradient","organic","textured","calm"],"cover":"/shaders/covers/da2b5efe-e846-40ac-a312-168c4b070a68.jpg","toneMapping":"neutral","components":[{"type":"SolidColor","id":"idmv139wvoarnt3mlfl","_key":"key_mv139wvoarnt3mlfl","props":{"color":"#f3efe6","o